   102	## Async dispatch
   103	
   104	**Async dispatch rule (enforced):** the resolver fails closed for GitHub-first strategies when `canonicalStateSummary.requiresAsyncDispatch` is `true` (default `required` mode) — inline invocation without an async run-id marker (`DEVLOOPS_RUN_ID`) is rejected for those routes. Under the Claude Code harness this requirement is relaxed automatically. See [Startup procedure](#startup-procedure).
